<workout_file>
	<author>Jarvis Chau (via TrainingPeaks)</author>
	<name>3 x 9-Minute Over Under Intervals</name>
	<description>3 minutes easy pedaling
1 minute fast pedal (low resistance, fast as you can pedal without bouncing in the saddle)
1 minute easy pedaling
1 minute max effort (100+rpm)
1 minute easy pedaling
1 minute max effort (100+rpm)
2 minutes easy pedaling

3 sets:

2 minutes Steady State intensity (perceived exertion 8/10)
1 Minute Climbing Repeat intensity (perceived exertion 9/10)
2 minutes Steady State intensity (perceived exertion 8/10)
1 Minute Climbing Repeat intensity (perceived exertion 9/10)
2 minutes Steady State intensity (perceived exertion 8/10)
1 Minute Climbing Repeat intensity (perceived exertion 9/10)
4 minute recovery

10-15 minutes to cool down.</description>
	<sportType>bike</sportType>
